================================================================================
A. exact constants
================================================================================
  cos(2 arcsin(1/(2 sqrt3))) = 1 - 2*(1/12) = 5/6 : True
  |1-e^{i gamma}|^2 = 2 - 2 cos gamma = 2 - 5/3 = 1/3 : True
  |e^{2 i kappa} - 1|^2 = |e^{120i}-1|^2 = 3 ; 3*(1/3) = 1  (unit side)
  gamma in degrees in (33.557309761921, 33.557309761921), width 1.58e-44
  psi = pi+gamma     in (213.557309761921, 213.557309761921)

================================================================================
B. k-arithmetic:  contradiction iff  k - |G1 u G2| < chi(Q)
================================================================================
  |G1 u G2| = 2  =>  |T'| = 4  =>  contradiction from a 5-chromatic unit-distance graph
  |G1 u G2| = 3  =>  |T'| = 3  =>  contradiction from the Moser spindle  (chi 4)
  |G1 u G2| = 4  =>  |T'| = 2  =>  contradiction from the unit triangle of Lemma 6.4  (chi 3)
  |G1 u G2| = 5  =>  |T'| = 1  =>  contradiction from a unit edge  (chi 2)
  |G1 u G2| = 6  =>  |T'| = 0  =>  contradiction from -- (5.2) alone already contradicts
  at a 6-cycle centre all palettes have size >= 2, so |G1 u G2| >= 4.

